cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mzdiff in your work, please cite it."
title: "mzdiff: compares two mzML files by meaning"
type: software
abstract: "mzdiff compares a reference mzML file with an output under test and reports every difference that changes what a reader would get, classed as critical, major, or minor. It pairs records in any order, ignores bookkeeping by rule, rates severities through the PSI-MS vocabulary, and reports data written in forms readers fail on."
url: "https://github.com/eneskemalergin/mzDiff"
repository-code: "https://github.com/eneskemalergin/mzDiff"
authors:
